# /etc/shop-hub/listen.conf: where waitress listens. Loopback only: cloudflared runs in
# this LXC, so everything, the shop's own phones included, comes in through the tunnel.
# Don't add the LXC's LAN address: that would be plain HTTP that skips Cloudflare (and
# Access), and sign-in doesn't work over it anyway (the cookies need https).
SHOP_LISTEN_ARGS=--listen=127.0.0.1:8080
